      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think `moduleContext.requiresFullInstall` itself uses [module.skipInstall](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/build/soong/+/4decad65e932a3c8c3b01cafd1f601535826c0c1:android/module_context.go;l\u003d519-521;drc\u003ddb901f84d8fc7716d9fccfb09fdaca20750025fe;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d0). IIUC, are you suggesting that we replace\n```\nfunc (m *moduleContext) requiresFullInstall() bool {\n\tif m.skipInstall() {\n\t\treturn false\n\t}\n\t...\n```\nwith\n```\nfunc (m *moduleContext) requiresFullInstall() bool {\n\t// START: This is a modification of skipInstall function without hideFromMake\n\tif m.module.base().commonProperties.SkipInstall {\n\t\treturn true\n\t}\n\n\tif !m.module.base().commonProperties.NamespaceExportedToMake {\n\t\treturn true\n\t}\n\n\treturn false\n\t// END\n\t\n\t// REST of requiresFullInstall\n```",
